    "About Plozz. Version %@, build %@. Bring all of your media together into one unified experience. Free forever and open source. Scan the on-screen code to view the GitHub repository.": {
      "comment": "Accessibility label for the Settings > About section on tvOS, describing the app and the QR code that opens the GitHub repository. The first %@ is the app version, and the second %@ is the build number.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "About Plozz. Version %1$@, build %2$@. Bring all of your media together into one unified experience. Free forever and open source. Scan the on-screen code to view the GitHub repository."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Over Plozz. Versie %1$@, build %2$@. Breng al je media samen in één centrale ervaring. Voor altijd gratis en open source. Scan de code op het scherm om de GitHub-repository te bekijken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "O Plozz. Wersja %1$@, kompilacja %2$@. Wszystkie Twoje multimedia w jednym, spójnym miejscu. Bezpłatnie na zawsze i na otwartej licencji. Zeskanuj kod na ekranie, aby wyświetlić repozytorium GitHub."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sobre o Plozz. Versão %1$@, compilação %2$@. Reúna todas as suas mídias em uma experiência unificada. Grátis para sempre e de código aberto. Escaneie o código na tela para ver o repositório no GitHub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
